\b Vibe Panel\b0\par
By Umberto Giacobbi. A holiday hobby project.\par
\par
Setup closes Vibe Panel before changing its files. If its hardware driver is still loaded, Windows may ask for administrator permission to remove it. Your settings and user themes are kept.\par
\par
Vibe Panel requests administrator access each time it starts, including at Windows sign-in. Windows asks for your approval. If you cancel, the app warns you that some sensors may be unavailable. Themes run with the same rights as the app.\par
\par
Themes run Python code on your computer. For now, download themes only from the official repository. My security review is unfinished.\par
